winbridge (0.4.0~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Adds distribution and community infrastructure (M6): a PPA source
    package and Flatpak manifest alongside the existing GitHub release
    tarball and .deb, tag-triggered release automation that builds and
    checksums all three from one `git tag`, and `winbridge report` — a
    local-only command that prints a filled-in hardware-report template
    (OS/kernel, CPU, GPU, Vulkan, Wine and prefix/DXVK state, toolchain
    availability) for a user to paste into an issue by hand. Nothing it
    gathers is transmitted anywhere on its own.
  * Adds COMPATIBILITY.md, seeded with what this repository has actually
    verified so far, and docs/distribution.md describing every install
    channel and how a version bump flows from tag to release.

